  "description": "The JackRabbit MG Cargo is the lightest cargo electric bike with the highest payload capacity; only 55 lbs, yet can haul nearly 10× its own weight.\nUnlike traditional cargo ebikes that weigh 80+ lbs and won't fit through your front door, the MG Cargo folds flat to 8 inches wide to fit in small spaces and the back of any car.\nWith a 749W cargo-geared motor, mullet wheel design, and a sturdy rack with 10+ standard attach points, this thing was built to get sh*t done: grocery runs, gear haul, or school pickups (compatible with the Thule Yepp 2 Maxi child seat and the JackRabbit Copilot Kit).\nArmed with 20 mph of 100% electric speed, an unlockable 24 mph Off-Road Mode, 48+ miles of range, hybrid hydraulic brakes, front and rear lights, and a wide center stand - your to-do list is toast.\nTested & compliant with UL2271 and UL2272. Ships pre-assembled (simply pop in the front wheel & handlebars, and go!).",
